00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:53.080
First, we want to understand
what are the key business

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:55.300
objectives of the chatbot.

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:56.920
What is your workflow like?

00:02:56.920 --> 00:02:59.140
Will a human be
part of the process,

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:02.110
or should the bot be able
to handle all questions?

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:05.330
