00:03:10.050 --> 00:03:11.900
Are most of those
questions static?

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:15.010
Is there a general
response for a question,

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:16.390
or are they dynamic questions?

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:19.540
